[2.000, "o", "wrote /home/kush/.local/config/perch/config.yaml\r\n\r\nPublish these DNS records:\r\nTYPE   NAME                            VALUE                                                               PRIORITY\r\nCNAME  bounces.perch.kush.in           vqiezua2jrndzmxwubrvzucfuee.bounces.dns.mxraven.email               \r\nCNAME  mxr1._domainkey.perch.kush.in   vqiezua2jrndzmxwubrvzucfuee.mxr1._domainkey.dkim.dns.mxraven.email  \r\nCNAME  mxr2._domainkey.perch.kush.in   vqiezua2jrndzmxwubrvzucfuee.mxr2._domainkey.dkim.dns.mxraven.email  \r\nTXT    _dmarc.perch.kush.in            v=DMARC1; p=quarantine                                              \r\nTXT    _mxraven-inbound.perch.kush.in  mxraven-inbound=inb-vepf4zao4ivsfsou4rq2xxdlav4                     \r\nMX     perch.kush.in                   smtp.mxraven.email                                                  \r\n\r\nnext: perch account add --config /home/kush/.local/config/perch/config.yaml --email you@perch.kush.in\r\nthen: perch serve --config /home/kush/.local/config/perch/config.yaml\r\n"]
